Z||000006||stsmithgt||09-21-2000||12:04 PM||||Have fun with it.  My 86GT, white w/grey interior is being screwed up in the shop right now.  Be sure to do the work yourself or find a GOOD trustworthy mechanic.  I think the mechanic I'm using is on crack.  I need to find a better one.  I think the mechanic I used for my hub work cost me my transmission over weekend because of his short comings.  I wish there was a mechanic around here that took pride in his work and actually could do the job right the first time.  He should have never given my car back if there was a chance of the tranny burning up in a 15 minute drive.  Anyway enjoy your new toy. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   signed "bitter boy"(for now.)||||reg||12
